<title>USA: SC&amp;T International names Pendley CFO.</title>
<headline>SC&amp;T International names Pendley CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>SC&amp;T International Inc said Monday it appointed William Pendley as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>SC&amp;T said Pendley commenced his duties at SC&amp;T Friday, March 28, 1997. He replaced Timothy Stocker who left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Prior to joining SC&amp;T, Pendley was at DIGEX Corporation, a business Internet services provider located in Beltsville, Maryland.</p>
